  "description": "The META SX V5 RIDE is built around ROCKSHOX suspension and SRAM components.\n• A 170mm Zeb fork offers a terrain-proof chassis with its 38mm stanchions. It inherits the new DebonAir + spring and the new Rush RC hydraulic cartridge. On the back, the Super Deluxe Select+ shock. Its end of stroke is better managed, and the additional cylinder increases oil volume for greater consistency.\n• Braking comes in the form of the SRAM DB8s. They are reliable and easy to use.\n• SPANK Spike Race 33 rims coupled with FORMULA hubs make up a robust and comfortable wheelset.\n• A SRAM NX Eagle 12-speed drivetrain will allow you to shift gears smoothly.",
